WEBVTT

01:23.793 --> 01:24.961
Don't go.

02:11.680 --> 02:14.519
I never properly told you.

02:15.855 --> 02:17.692
I already know.

03:00.903 --> 03:02.907
AUGUST 1, 2020

03:02.907 --> 03:04.911
SHINJUKU

03:05.328 --> 03:08.919
Ah... with that, it ends.

03:08.919 --> 03:12.635
Too bad my youth wasn't more like that...

03:13.094 --> 03:16.893
Okay! Now that I've seen
my favorite manga to the end...

03:17.227 --> 03:18.396
It's about time...

03:19.858 --> 03:21.653
...I end myself!

03:28.626 --> 03:29.460
Hey.

03:32.174 --> 03:33.552
That's dangerous.

03:36.558 --> 03:41.442
I just... wanted a shot at a passionate romance like
the one in this manga!

03:43.906 --> 03:47.162
But thanks to this body, that'll never happen...

03:49.041 --> 03:50.335
That's why I've got to die.

03:50.544 --> 03:51.755
Don't mess with me.

03:56.807 --> 03:58.101
Listen!

03:58.769 --> 04:01.107
If you touch my body...

04:01.148 --> 04:04.488
You'll, uh...
contract an incurable disease...

04:04.656 --> 04:05.700
...and die!

04:07.327 --> 04:08.162
I mean it!

04:09.708 --> 04:11.920
I've got nothing good to live
for with a body like this.

04:13.256 --> 04:14.091
That's why I've got to die.

04:15.970 --> 04:16.387
"Blsh"?

04:18.015 --> 04:18.767
Huh?

04:23.109 --> 04:24.236
How did this happen?

04:24.863 --> 04:26.616
Huh? Did I do that?

04:28.996 --> 04:33.964
A deadly disease transmitted by touch?
Never heard of it!

04:34.006 --> 04:35.509
Sick!

04:36.218 --> 04:39.934
Suicides nowadays have
been gettin' kinda stale, y'know!

04:41.353 --> 04:44.026
Well? My hand was all over ya.

04:47.282 --> 04:52.000
What's gonna happen? Where's it gonna hurt?
The outside? Maybe from within?

04:53.002 --> 04:53.796
It's coming.

04:54.088 --> 04:54.631
Wuzzat?

04:55.048 --> 04:56.050
My unluck!

04:57.344 --> 04:58.012
Huh?

05:07.113 --> 05:08.407
I'm so... sorry.

05:10.286 --> 05:11.790
I've done it again.

05:12.667 --> 05:15.171
I've dragged another person into this.

05:15.798 --> 05:18.637
And it's all because I took too long to do it.

05:24.566 --> 05:25.275
Hey.

05:31.078 --> 05:33.207
Now I get it!

05:33.457 --> 05:36.380
That "disease" stuff is just
a front to protect others!

05:36.673 --> 05:39.721
What? The head of that guy from earlier?

05:42.142 --> 05:43.185
Sick!

05:47.402 --> 05:50.784
This means you're... on this side.

05:51.536 --> 05:54.249
<i>H-His body... is repairing itself?</i>

06:04.938 --> 06:07.610
Looks like today's my lucky day.

06:11.408 --> 06:13.496
No!

06:13.914 --> 06:15.751
It's a zombie!

06:18.172 --> 06:20.511
Z-Zombie!

06:23.391 --> 06:27.775
Why you... don't you dare...

06:27.900 --> 06:29.486
...lump me in with those rotting meat sacks!

06:30.948 --> 06:33.369
I'm... undead!

06:36.751 --> 06:40.300
Hate to cut to the chase,
but I've got a few questions for ya.

06:40.634 --> 06:44.349
Pretty sure I heard you say back there
your "unluck" was coming, right?

06:48.734 --> 06:51.990
Can't stick around here any longer.
Gotta move.

06:51.990 --> 06:52.992
Y'better hold on.

06:53.325 --> 06:53.994
Huh?

06:58.085 --> 06:59.630
Stop!

06:59.881 --> 07:02.720
Scary! So scary! No!

07:06.811 --> 07:10.318
How didja like leaping from building
to building like that, eh?

07:10.443 --> 07:15.621
Just so y'know, I regenerated my torn-off legs
at high speeds and used the momentum to...

07:16.539 --> 07:18.668
<i>Whatever he is,
I need to get out of here!</i>

07:23.135 --> 07:24.972
Where do you think you're going?

07:24.972 --> 07:27.937
I've still got questions.
You're not going anywhere.

07:28.187 --> 07:30.483
You're touching my leg!

07:30.483 --> 07:33.990
You'll trigger my unluck again!
Let go of me!

07:34.867 --> 07:38.207
I should be A-OK if I only touch your clothes, yeah?

07:38.415 --> 07:41.631
Wh-Whatever, just let me go!

07:42.132 --> 07:44.595
Sure, I don't mind,
but it's a long way down.

07:47.601 --> 07:48.687
When did we get here?

07:48.937 --> 07:53.195
Explain this so-called unluck,
and I'll help you. Deal?

07:55.158 --> 07:59.332
F-Forget it! I was planning
on dying today anyway!

07:59.332 --> 08:02.130
Your threats don't scare me one bit!

08:07.473 --> 08:08.392
Hold on!

08:09.060 --> 08:11.398
Fall... I'm gonna fall!

08:11.733 --> 08:14.112
Okay, I really am scared!

08:14.487 --> 08:18.955
I'll talk! I'll talk, I said!

08:27.806 --> 08:28.349
Now spill it.

08:35.822 --> 08:37.576
It started ten years ago.

08:43.087 --> 08:45.676
<i>I was only eight years old.</i>

08:45.759 --> 08:47.930
<i>My parents were heading overseas on business
and I was seeing them off.</i> 2010

08:47.930 --> 08:49.934
<i>My parents were heading overseas on business
and I was seeing them off.</i>
TOKYO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT

08:51.688 --> 08:57.407
<i>They said they'd be gone for a week.
So they hugged me a whole bunch before they left.</i>

09:07.845 --> 09:09.682
<i>About half an hour later...</i>

09:13.480 --> 09:15.359
<i>Their plane encountered unexpected engine trouble.</i>

09:16.236 --> 09:18.825
<i>All 270 people aboard,
including my parents...</i>

09:19.869 --> 09:20.912
<i>...died.</i>

09:24.419 --> 09:27.509
It was then I learned,
although the degree of it varies...

09:27.509 --> 09:31.559
...that people who touch me end up getting hurt.

09:33.103 --> 09:37.403
That's how I figured out I caused
what happened to Mom and Dad.

09:38.155 --> 09:39.909
And since then,
I've been covering my bare skin to-

09:40.994 --> 09:43.499
So you're saying the biggest strokes of unluck...

09:43.499 --> 09:45.921
...hit when you get hugged, right?

09:46.881 --> 09:49.386
Hold on! What are you-
Were you even listening?

09:49.386 --> 09:52.225
Oh, I was listenin'.
Now I'm testing it out.

09:52.225 --> 09:55.272
Let go of me!
And why are you copping a feel?

09:55.314 --> 09:57.485
‘Cuz... it needs direct contact, right?

09:57.485 --> 09:59.280
That's no excuse!

10:07.673 --> 10:09.760
<i>Need to run while I still can!</i>

10:11.848 --> 10:13.350
You lying little brat!

10:13.350 --> 10:15.146
This ain't gonna cut it at all!

10:17.526 --> 10:18.653
Huh?

10:18.653 --> 10:21.032
No!

10:22.160 --> 10:22.745
Hmm?

10:23.287 --> 10:24.372
<i>Really? Seriously?</i>

10:24.874 --> 10:28.422
<i>My entire life is over...
because I slipped on a banana peel?</i>

10:29.007 --> 10:31.052
<i>I never got to experience anything!</i>

10:31.470 --> 10:33.474
<i>Fashion! Love!</i>

10:33.474 --> 10:37.023
<i>I didn't even get to do anything girly...
not a single thing!</i>

10:47.544 --> 10:49.715
<i>No...! Not like this!</i>

10:51.134 --> 10:53.430
<i>I'm not ready!
Not yet!</i>

11:07.584 --> 11:09.045
You dummy.

11:09.588 --> 11:11.299
No way I'm lettin' you die.

11:12.218 --> 11:14.305
- Not now that I've finally found it.
- Huh?

11:14.557 --> 11:17.813
The power... that'll give me a real death!

11:17.813 --> 11:19.942
There's a rule you tried
to hide from me back there.

11:20.735 --> 11:24.994
If I figure it out, then I can make
an even bigger stroke of unluck happen, yeah?

11:27.331 --> 11:29.962
And maybe the greatest stroke
of unluck you've got...

11:29.962 --> 11:34.178
...can finally snuff out my ridiculously long life!

11:34.763 --> 11:36.809
Now this party's gettin' started!

11:36.809 --> 11:41.151
Time to head back to my hideout
and figure out this unluck ability!

11:41.527 --> 11:45.242
Yes. He appears to be en route
to his hideout with the new breed.

11:47.914 --> 11:48.958
Roger that.

11:49.459 --> 11:52.298
We will apprehend her
after confirming her ability.

12:02.945 --> 12:07.203
How long I touch you correlates
to the size of your unluck!

12:07.871 --> 12:09.708
Next up: surface area!

12:10.710 --> 12:14.342
Take off your clothes! I'm gonna try clinging
to as wide an area of your body as I...

12:14.467 --> 12:15.302
...can.

12:18.893 --> 12:20.522
Where do you think you're going?

12:20.605 --> 12:22.233
There's no way I'm stripping for you!

12:22.400 --> 12:24.989
Please, just give this up already!

12:25.072 --> 12:28.830
This is all because you're hidin'
the rules in the first place!

12:28.830 --> 12:32.002
How is this my fault?
I just didn't want to tell you!

12:32.002 --> 12:33.631
C'mon, it's fine!
No big deal!

12:33.798 --> 12:35.467
It's a big deal to my heart!

12:54.798 --> 12:55.592
Helluva mane.

13:00.810 --> 13:02.689
He's seen it all!

13:02.689 --> 13:06.781
I can't help it!
No one's able to cut it for me!

13:07.198 --> 13:11.247
Any hairstylist would just end up dead!

13:21.309 --> 13:23.230
Wh-What are you doing?

13:23.230 --> 13:27.029
Don't move. As long as I'm touching you,
no unluck'll come my way.

13:27.029 --> 13:28.448
I'll wrap this up in the meantime.

13:28.448 --> 13:30.912
But once you let go,
all the unluck will hit at once and...

13:30.912 --> 13:32.916
Who are you worrying about?

13:33.375 --> 13:35.379
I'm undead, you know.

13:38.051 --> 13:39.888
Were you a stylist before?

13:40.222 --> 13:41.767
Ages ago.

13:45.567 --> 13:46.735
You're all set.

13:46.902 --> 13:49.156
Pretty good for my first time in a while, eh?

13:49.156 --> 13:51.662
Really? For real?

13:51.662 --> 13:54.835
Quit being all shy
and take a look in the mirror.

14:01.306 --> 14:02.057
See?

14:05.397 --> 14:08.738
Oh, um... thank you.

14:09.907 --> 14:13.330
All righty! I was holdin' on
to you for 15 minutes!

14:13.330 --> 14:15.627
This one's bound to be
a whopper, right?

14:17.338 --> 14:18.340
How should I know?

14:24.393 --> 14:29.529
Much obliged... "Unluck",
Miss Fuko Izumo.

14:29.529 --> 14:32.869
Thanks to you... he let down his guard.

14:33.411 --> 14:34.455
Who are you people?

14:35.290 --> 14:36.250
Hold that thought.

14:37.461 --> 14:40.467
We'll contain Undead in this special capsule first,
as per protocol.

14:42.429 --> 14:44.851
Now he won't be able to regenerate.

14:44.851 --> 14:45.979
Why would you do-

14:48.400 --> 14:49.778
Aren't you guys on my side?

14:49.778 --> 14:52.116
Your side? Us?

14:52.116 --> 14:54.078
Surely you must be joking.

14:55.205 --> 14:59.213
Our job is to police any unselected Negators,
such as yourselves...

14:59.213 --> 15:02.554
...or any UMAs that throw the world into chaos.

15:02.762 --> 15:04.265
<i>What's he talking about?</i>

15:06.603 --> 15:08.733
Still, your ability is quite incredible.

15:09.108 --> 15:12.448
You negate the luck of whoever touches you,
and kill them.

15:12.448 --> 15:15.245
An ability perfectly suited for murder.

15:15.663 --> 15:19.629
However, touching you through cloth
keeps one perfectly safe.

15:19.629 --> 15:22.384
Your weakness is that once its conditions are known,
it's easy to counter it.

15:24.639 --> 15:27.144
You want to do something with my power?

15:28.856 --> 15:31.570
Well, given that we can utilize it...

15:31.820 --> 15:34.743
What use is there besides killing?

15:36.663 --> 15:39.711
I'm certain Undead captured you
for that very reason.

15:39.920 --> 15:40.671
Huh?

15:40.838 --> 15:44.721
After all, you'd be quite
the ferocious weapon if you bent to his will.

15:44.721 --> 15:46.432
Y-You're wrong!

15:47.184 --> 15:50.691
We may have just met today,
but he...

15:50.691 --> 15:54.406
...only used my unluck on himself
so that only he could die.

15:54.699 --> 15:56.244
Don't think that he's anything like you!

15:56.244 --> 15:58.791
Compared to you guys, that zombie-

15:59.668 --> 16:02.047
I'd advise you to watch your mouth.

16:02.381 --> 16:05.721
I don't mind disposing of you,
instead of capturing.

16:05.972 --> 16:10.355
Th-The zombie... didn't have any gloves on.

16:10.355 --> 16:12.819
He touched me... without an ounce of fear...

16:14.823 --> 16:16.535
I'm so sorry, zombie...

16:16.535 --> 16:21.670
This is because you cut my hair.
But I'm so grateful you did.

16:21.670 --> 16:24.466
Thank you so much, Zombie.

16:32.859 --> 16:35.322
A lightning bolt?
Is this part of her unluck as well?

16:35.322 --> 16:38.328
No... the activation requirements haven't been met.

16:38.746 --> 16:41.375
Perhaps... it was a stroke of his own unluck.

16:41.668 --> 16:42.587
He's wrong.

16:42.962 --> 16:44.215
That was no fluke.

16:45.258 --> 16:46.093
Zombie!

16:51.980 --> 16:53.567
Intel says guns are ineffective.

16:53.567 --> 16:55.487
Attack him all at once and cut him down.

16:55.487 --> 16:58.201
He may be undead, but he's
an amateur when it comes to combat!

16:58.577 --> 16:59.746
Roger that, sir!

16:59.996 --> 17:03.587
Amateur, eh? Maybe now...

17:04.923 --> 17:06.425
But the past is a different story!

17:06.843 --> 17:09.014
<i>Usually, I don't have enough
space for it all.</i>

17:09.014 --> 17:11.143
<i>So I put a cork in my brain...</i>

17:11.143 --> 17:13.899
<i>...to keep 100 years' worth
of memories bottled up!</i>

17:23.585 --> 17:25.213
Otherwise...

17:27.510 --> 17:29.848
I'd go off the rails!

17:34.774 --> 17:39.199
Now I get it. Getting my noggin sliced off
wasn't your unluck's doing.

17:40.452 --> 17:43.667
The unluck for the haircut was that lightning bolt.

17:47.382 --> 17:50.848
Guess I need to test for time-lag gimmicks.

17:51.223 --> 17:52.476
Zombie...

17:52.769 --> 17:59.406
So you're not simply an undead... but skills you cultivated
through your long life are also your weapons?

17:59.406 --> 18:03.039
More or less. I've been alive a hell
of a lot longer than any of you.

18:03.039 --> 18:03.707
Indeed.

18:05.335 --> 18:08.424
In response, I will have
to implement a rather underhanded measure.

18:09.594 --> 18:12.474
Hand over your head-without regenerating.

18:12.474 --> 18:15.438
Fail to comply and I'll cut
her head off instead.

18:15.438 --> 18:17.317
You'll what?
That's meaningless!

18:17.317 --> 18:18.695
Oh, I believe there is meaning.

18:20.908 --> 18:23.664
He seems to have quite
a lot of stock in you, after all.

18:24.164 --> 18:26.837
What? You're not gonna fight?

18:26.837 --> 18:29.509
Man, just when I thought
it'd be fun to take you on.

18:32.139 --> 18:33.182
What are you doing?

18:33.349 --> 18:37.065
"What"? I'm cuttin' off my head
to save your neck.

18:37.065 --> 18:41.031
I-I can see that,
but then you'll end up captured, too!

18:41.031 --> 18:41.950
Guess I will, eh?

18:41.950 --> 18:43.537
Then stop! Don't do it!

18:44.037 --> 18:49.799
I can't take it anymore...
People around me getting hurt... dying...

18:50.509 --> 18:53.515
Even if it's you, who can't die...

18:54.266 --> 18:57.439
So, please, just forget about me!
Don't worry...

18:57.690 --> 18:58.483
Wuzzat?

18:58.609 --> 19:00.236
Listen to what I'm saying!

19:00.696 --> 19:02.115
Enough.

19:02.115 --> 19:05.038
I don't give a crap about your opinions.

19:05.790 --> 19:11.300
I had fun today. If I ever see ya again down
the road, let's party up!

19:12.135 --> 19:13.764
<i>The truth is, I do know...</i>

19:16.268 --> 19:18.941
<i>...the way to trigger
the biggest stroke of unluck.</i>

19:22.197 --> 19:24.284
<i>This might not go well, but...</i>

19:34.388 --> 19:36.350
What... did you just do?

19:36.685 --> 19:40.400
Nothing special.
Just thought it was nice.

19:40.901 --> 19:43.574
To be able to cast all worries aside
and touch someone!

19:43.949 --> 19:46.287
Here it comes! My unluck!

19:46.538 --> 19:47.623
What are you babbling-

19:48.750 --> 19:50.336
Now I get it.

19:51.046 --> 19:51.965
Run for it!

19:52.090 --> 19:52.925
Okay!

19:54.846 --> 19:56.641
Sorry, bud.

19:56.933 --> 19:58.604
We got you beat.

19:58.687 --> 19:59.438
When you ran into me...

20:00.566 --> 20:04.323
...and her, your luck ran out!

20:06.118 --> 20:08.540
Sick! Wicked sick!

20:27.745 --> 20:28.872
Zombie...

20:35.928 --> 20:37.347
Hot damn.

20:40.813 --> 20:44.027
I've never taken a meteorite
to the face till just now.

20:44.277 --> 20:45.488
Zombie!

20:45.698 --> 20:48.452
I ain't no zombie. I'm undead.

20:49.496 --> 20:53.337
Good assist back there.
That was some nice unluck.

20:55.299 --> 20:57.053
Well, I'm not sure I'd call it nice.

21:04.569 --> 21:08.577
TO BE CONTINUED

21:08.910 --> 21:14.756
U-Um, I'm Fuko Izumo!
What's your name?

21:15.006 --> 21:18.179
Don't remember.
Undead's good enough, ain't it?

21:18.179 --> 21:22.688
Not at all!
I guess... I'll have to name you, then!

21:26.529 --> 21:29.577
Andy! Because you're "ahn-dead"!

21:31.581 --> 21:32.792
Whatever floats your boat.

21:34.211 --> 21:35.046
Yup!

21:36.758 --> 21:39.221
Still, a kiss did all this, huh?

21:39.555 --> 21:40.473
Uh-huh.

21:42.352 --> 21:44.565
Guess next we gotta have ***.

21:49.826 --> 21:51.453
What're you runnin' for?

21:53.875 --> 21:56.213
<i>"Undead" Andy.</i>

21:58.718 --> 22:01.181
<i>"Unluck" Fuko Izumo.</i>

22:01.724 --> 22:03.394
C'mon, I know you're curious, too!

22:03.895 --> 22:08.947
<i>This is the story of their quest
for the greatest death ever.</i>

22:15.878 --> 22:20.888
UNDEAD AND UNLUCK

23:38.960 --> 23:40.379
PREVIEW

23:40.463 --> 23:43.762
<i>A girl seemingly finds her place in her world.</i>

23:43.762 --> 23:46.642
<i>However, the next shadow pushes
her repose further away.</i>

23:47.435 --> 23:51.401
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 2-Union.</i>

23:51.652 --> 23:53.865
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
